{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/demo-room.gif?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cozy room decoration game you play as Dalia, a young witch returning home after university. As you clean and decorate beautiful areas to your liking, you will help the town and the magical creatures that inhabit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_customize.png?t=1745208015\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/stuff.gif?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in relaxing gameplay with no timers as you decorate areas at your own pace. With a touch of magic you can adjust colors, sizes and magical effects to create the coziest spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_coven.png?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/meetyourcoven.png?t=1745208015\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to the town's inhabitants  and learn more about them as you clean and decorate their shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_creatures.png?t=1745208015\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/cosmo.gif?t=1745208015\" />Help magical creatures and give them love as you discover what is the cause of the mysterious corruption affecting them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_creative.png?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/room_caravan_switch.gif?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the rooms, furniture and hundreds of objects available for you to play with! Be creative and make any Magic Room you can dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_features_2.png?t=1745208015\" />\ud83d\udd2e Story mode - Help the town as you decorate multiple\u00a0areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 Creative Mode - Create your own rooms with hundreds of objects at your fingertips.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Decorating Freedom - Complete tasks as you make each space your own by customising each room to your liking. <br>\ud83e\uddf8 Cute and Cozy Art-style - Experience a soothing atmosphere with lofi songs and customizable weather.  <br>\ud83e\uddff Calm meditative gameplay - Relax as you play at your own pace with no timers. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2390130?t=1745208015","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745208015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/a4dd938d29cba325afd9a43e10ae98904af43454/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745208015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/a4dd938d29cba325afd9a43e10ae98904af43454/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745208015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/demo-room.gif?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this cozy room decoration game you play as Dalia, a young witch returning home after university. As you clean and decorate beautiful areas to your liking, you will help the town and the magical creatures that inhabit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_customize.png?t=1745208015\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/stuff.gif?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in relaxing gameplay with no timers as you decorate areas at your own pace. With a touch of magic you can adjust colors, sizes and magical effects to create the coziest spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_coven.png?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/meetyourcoven.png?t=1745208015\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to the town's inhabitants  and learn more about them as you clean and decorate their shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_creatures.png?t=1745208015\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/cosmo.gif?t=1745208015\" />Help magical creatures and give them love as you discover what is the cause of the mysterious corruption affecting them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_creative.png?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/room_caravan_switch.gif?t=1745208015\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the rooms, furniture and hundreds of objects available for you to play with! Be creative and make any Magic Room you can dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/extras/header_features_2.png?t=1745208015\" />\ud83d\udd2e Story mode - Help the town as you decorate multiple\u00a0areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 Creative Mode - Create your own rooms with hundreds of objects at your fingertips.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Decorating Freedom - Complete tasks as you make each space your own by customising each room to your liking. <br>\ud83e\uddf8 Cute and Cozy Art-style - Experience a soothing atmosphere with lofi songs and customizable weather.  <br>\ud83e\uddff Calm meditative gameplay - Relax as you play at your own pace with no timers. </p>","developers":["Tiny Kiwi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390130/header.jpg?t=1745208015","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257046793,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046793/movie480.mp4?t=1723808884","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046793/movie_max.mp4?t=1723808884"},"name":"Design & Conjure - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257046793/movie.293x1